      en: ["Al Fashir sits at an elevation of approximately 700 meters above sea level.", "The city was founded in the late 18th century as a permanent royal camp.", "The Ali Dinar Palace Museum was built in 1912 and houses royal artifacts.", "Al Fashir is a major regional center for the export of gum arabic.", "The University of Al Fashir was officially opened in 1990.", "The city was historically a key stop on the 'Forty Days Road' to Egypt."],
