      en: ["Nyala sits at an elevation of approximately 673 meters above sea level.", "The railway line from Khartoum reached Nyala in 1959, sparking its boom.", "The name Nyala translates to 'place of chatting' in the local Daju language.", "The city is a primary collection point for gum arabic exports from Darfur.", "The University of Nyala was officially founded in 1994.", "Nyala is situated near the Wadi Nyala, which provides vital seasonal water."],
