      en: ["Kaduqli is situated at an elevation of approximately 490 meters in the Nuba foothills.", "The city is a major hub for the ginning and processing of high-quality cotton.", "It serves as a key logistical base for the UNISFA peacekeeping mission in Abyei.", "Annual rainfall in this region is significantly higher than in northern Sudanese cities.", "The area is internationally famous for the traditional sport of Nuba Wrestling.", "The city operates a regional airport that is essential for cargo and humanitarian flights."],
      es: ["Kaduqli es la capital del estado sudanés de la región SK.", "Situado en el estado del noreste de África, Sudán.", "Región caracterizada por el Nilo y el desierto de Nubia.", "Clima mayoritariamente cálido y seco, con zonas desérticas y del Sahel.", "Accesible a través de la red nacional de carreteras y ríos a lo largo del Nilo."],
