      en: ["Doka is located in the southeastern Gedaref State near the Ethiopian border.", "The region is renowned for rain-fed agriculture of sesame, sorghum, and sunflowers.", "Doka is one of the most important centers for high-quality sesame export in Sudan.", "The town is situated at an elevation of approximately 600 meters above sea level.", "During harvest season, the population swells significantly with seasonal laborers.", "Doka is linked by a regional road to the state capital, Gedaref city."],
